---
description: Exact-head evidence and honest completion claims for CI, release, audit, and deployment work
globs: "{.github/workflows/**,docs/**,scripts/**}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Use exact commit SHAs and distinguish local checks, hosted CI, preview deployment, and production runtime evidence. A skipped or unavailable check is NOT VERIFIED. Do not claim merge or deploy readiness when required exact-head evidence is absent.
